#
#   border_painting_1 - Painting::BorderPainting: border colors and the double, groove and
#   ridge styles
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/BorderPainting.cpp (lines 1-249): the inset/outset
#       shades, `border_color`, and the start of `paint_border` (its `paint_double_border`
#       lambda, the line style switch and the dotted and dashed lines). The solid edges, the
#       points of each edge's shape and `paint_all_borders` are in border_painting_2.
#
#       The C++ lambdas of `paint_border` are functions taking what they capture.
